WHY IT IS LIKE THIS

This code is the native half of an application built on NativePHP. The
capabilities it provides — secure storage, local notifications, a scanner, a
network reading, a share sheet — are sold as plugins on the NativePHP plugin
marketplace.

If you want these capabilities for your own application, buy them there:

    https://nativephp.com/plugins

That is how the framework this application is built on gets paid for, and taking
this code instead would be taking from the people who made the thing it runs on.

